From 788261edfa245a206b980e9d94dbe46772854ccc Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Antidote1911 <antidote1911@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 07:45:43 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] menu: rounded corners and drop-shadow (Packarch)

New theme options, off by default (labwc unchanged without them):
menu.corner.radius (clamped to menu.border.width), menu.shadow.size and
menu.shadow.color. Border, fill and shadow are drawn in one scaled_buffer
per menu, rendered again for the scale of the output; only the menu
accepts input, not its shadow.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
